==Rules==
{{StageRule|13thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Possessed Silver Nyanko Ranger]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>.
*1 [[Madam Peng]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Despite the scary looking boss, he actually deals negligeable DPS and can be stalled with mere [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]] and [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cats]] to considerable success. He is, however, very tanky, and this needs to be taken care of with strong attackers like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]]. Bring [[Ribbon Cat (Special Cat)|Pink Nyanko Ranger]] to snipe the Madam Peng when she appears; she's the only threatening support here aside from the boss. You don't want this battle dragging for too long, else you'll run out of cash, so take care of Possessed Silver Nyanko Ranger as quickly as possible and claim your victory.

